      "writtenOn": "2015-08-20T01:23:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "What does \u0027PMIC will be forced to emergency shutdown\u0027 mean? If we\u0027re in S5 (not deep) it doesn\u0027t matter. We bring the x86 side down as best we can on all our chromebooks. We don\u0027t actually sit in S5 but for like 10 seconds.",
      "parentUuid": "243ac5f6_72f8f670",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 281,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 281,
        "endChar": 1
      },
