        "id": 1128369
      },
      "writtenOn": "2015-08-20T18:15:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Emergency shut down \u003d PMIC will be out of sequence if we forcefully shut down the PMIC even though SLP_SUS is high.\nReason I added return POWER_S5 is to check SLP_SUS whent low every 10s.",
      "parentUuid": "243e454a_20728ad6",
