      "message": "This is dramatically different from *every* chromebook we\u0027ve ever shipped. We never stay in S5.\n\nWhat are implications of this? To me it seems like a nop because RTC is the only thing kept alive with we assert GPIO_G3_SLEEP_EN. All rails go down so it doesn\u0027t matter.",
